      "line2": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-2vw\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">You work in one of the world’s most demanding, fast-paced environments. You need durable, powerful connected devices to help save lives and coordinate teams to deliver the highest quality of care. We are excited to get to know you better and work with you to help you deliver the best care possible.</span></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-2vw\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">Please fill out the form below to connect with one of our product experts.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n",
